অথবা, বাংলায় অনুবাদ কর :
The aim of education is to make a man fully fit for himself and
the society. It means to develop the whole man, his body, mind
and soul. It is education which aims at providing a child with
opportunities so that it can bring to light it's all latent qualities.
An educated man should be gentle, polite, thoughtful, creative,
kind, respectful, sympathetic and co-operative. So, all of us
should try our best to be educated and to serve humanity and the
